#name "Triton Sentinel"
#descr "Tritons were an outsider race from the Elemental Plane of Water. Noble by nature, they would readily sacrifice themselves to protect others and did so regularly in the darkest depths of the seas, where even other aquatic races rarely took note. All tritons were engaged in this sacred task.   

Triton Sentinels were well-equipped for the task, with coral tridents, shellmail armor and helmets, and the blessings of their god, Persana, provided by their Theurge commanders.

While Tritons could take to the land without fear, they lost many of their physical advantages when out of water. They much preferred the deepest seas. Most lived far below a comfortable depth for merfolk and sea elves, and could safely dive to depths only krakens and other denizens of the utterdark dared to tread. "
