#descr "Shoalguards were selected from among the commoners in aquatic elven communities at a young age for their athleticism and agility. While war was not their sole profession, the shoalguards could be called upon as a rapid reaction force. While not as highly trained or accustomed to battle as rangers or other more specialist warriors, the shoalguards were quick, flexible, and reliable.

In addition to carrying coral blades capable of inflicting difficult-to-staunch wounds, they carried the Aqilari, a specialized underwater dart that could also be used defensively like a sai. 

