#name "The Living Reef"
#descr "Qos is the Grand Savant of the Fifth Order and Paragon of the Maalirni Order. He is omnipresent across the city of Myth Nantar but he is also one of its greatest mysteries, for his form is the entire living reef system that covers the ancient elven capital. He speaks telepathically, personally controls and operates the ancient mythal that protects the city, and can extend his crysocoral body to bury or block entry to any place in the city to aid in its defense. 

Qos was born a Triton early in the Second of the Five Epochs chronicled in Serôsian history. This was the Time of the Elves and saw the rise and fall of the sea elven empire of Aryselmalyr. The elves joined the Dukar orders at the academy-town of Nantar and grew the city into a great undersea capital. The elves and Dukars created a protective Mythal of extraordinary power around the city in -3000 DR, further cementing Myth Nantar's place in Faerûnian history. However, greed, hubris and unending war eventually brought ruin to Aryselmalyr. Qos, already ancient, chose to remain and fuse his being with the living reef, abosorbing the power of the crysocoral so that he could protect the city and maintain the Mythal. 

The Third Epoch saw the rise and fall of the great Merfolk empires, and in the end, the total destruction of the Dukar orders. Qos instructed the few surviving Dukars to join him in hiding in order to preserve their knowledge for a future time, when all of Serôs would need them again. "
