#descr "Triton Tapaleros wield the tapal, a traditional two-handed blade invented by the tritons that is uniquely suited to underwater combat. All tritons are trained from a young age in its use. The Tapeleros also wear Silverweave armor, designed to protect triton soft spots in their otherwise tough natural skin. 

All tritons can leave the water for adventures on land, but few do so as they lose their natural advantages when out of the deeps, including their advantages in the dark. 

Centuries ago, the triton fought a number of elemental evils within the Elemental Plane of Water. They warred against krakens and aboleths and many others — eventually forcing them into the Darkest Depths. The tritons then waited for their enemies' return. After nearly a milennia of waiting and searching, they learned that their enemies had fled into the Prime Material Plane. Feeling guilty from allowing this to occur, the tritons pursued. Some came to Faerûn and spread across the oceans of Toril, banishing their foes to the farthest reaches and creating protectorates that served to guard many portals and deep sea trenches. Triton cities spread throughout the seafloor, remote and at times entirely isolated. They sometimes traded with the Shalarin, Sea Elves, and Merfolk, but concerned themselves primarily with their vigilant watch over the deeps." 
